WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:05.819
Film Courage: Well you talk about how you still feel
like you're struggling. To the outside

00:00:05.819 --> 00:00:09.630
world it doesn't appear that way and it
appears that you two are doing great. How do you

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:15.179
process rejection? I mean what's your way of dealing with it?

00:00:15.179 --> 00:00:18.210
I know you're saying we're doing it for
the love of it and you know but we're

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:22.500
all human beings you all get on this
bipolar ride where we feel badly one day

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.640
in this business and then the negative
feel like everybody loves us. Mark Duplass, filmmaker/actor/producer: Yeah

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:33.450
I mean we're really fortunate
right now in that you know we do get

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:38.430
to do stuff. Even though we
get rejected from some things we want to

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:42.239
do, there's always one thing that's got a
"yes" going on and and so I think that

00:00:42.239 --> 00:00:48.469
they the best answer we can come up with
is keep a lot of irons in the fire and

00:00:48.469 --> 00:00:52.620
it's sort of you play the numbers game a
little bit and it diminishes the

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:56.250
rejections because you have some other
things going on but I think you have to

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:59.699
be smart and be careful about how you
put yourself out there for instance I am

00:00:59.699 --> 00:01:04.110
an actor but I don't go out an audition
a lot because it just kills my spirit to

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:09.960
do that you know and it's really hard
and you know we could if we wanted to

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:16.650
engage weekly on these big writing
assignments that are open for for people

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:20.670
to come in and say here's my take on
this job I want to get this job if you

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:25.439
do that you get rejected 49 out of 50
times and then the one that you do get

00:01:25.439 --> 00:01:30.270
means you're doing really well but
that's 49 rejections you know so we

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:34.079
don't engage in that process as well so
we just try to protect ourselves to a

00:01:34.079 --> 00:01:36.470
certain degree

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:40.980
you know again try to keep a couple of
things going at once in case certain

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:49.560
things burn out it's like dating yes it
said it's just like marriage you need

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:55.700
like you need like five or six wives
yeah

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:05.229
you

